window.products.push({"id":869212,"name":"Tangkula up to 60 Inches Farmhouse TV Stand with Sliding Barn Doors, Side Sliding Door & Height Adjustable Shelves, Wooden TV Cabinet for Home Living ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wAALKVChL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Description Our sliding barn door TV stand provides convenience for friends and family entertainment and helps store everything you need. It accommodating most flat screen TVs up to 60\" and the maximum bearing capacity is up to 140 lbs. This TV stand with black metal rail features barn style sliding doors gives the home décor a rustic vibe. An integrated cable management system hides and manages unsightly wires and cables. You can use this console in any room as a TV stand and a beautiful place to store audio or video components, games or books according to your personal needs. Feature Accommodates most flat screen TVs up to 60\" and up to 140 lbsBarn style doors slide to conceal side storage cabinets or center storage shelvesAmple space for cable boxes, DVRs, game consoles, and other audio visual equipmentCoated metal rail system prevents rusting and annoying noiseMulti-functional stand for bedroom, dining room or hallway for display and storageIntegrated cable management system hides and manages unsightly wiresFinely finished with a plank style top adds rustic atmosphere Easy-to-assemble, including easy-to-follow instructions and full set of hardwareSized just right for a comfortable viewing experience while keeping your TV stable Specification Color: Brown/GrayMaterial: Engineered WoodDimension: 54\"x15.5\"x32\"(L x W x H) Net Weight: 95 lbsMaximum Capacity: 140 lbsPackage includes: 1 x TV Stand1 x Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wAALKVChL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tangkula","source_asin":"B0875SQWT1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0875SQWT1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0875SQWT1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869213,"name":"Beatou 3 Stage Knife Sharpener - Designed for Straight Edge Blades,Steel,Paring Knives,Chefs Knives,Specialty Knives,and Utility Knives,with Ceramic,S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xgVMEYswL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 3 Stage Knife Sharpener is intended for straight edge blades Are you afraid of cutting yourself when sharpening your knife? Relax, you don’t have to be! We’ve designed this 3 Stage knife sharpener to be as safe as can be. It comes with an ergonomic handle that gives you superior grip, and keeps your hand away from the blade thanks to its length. The base is also rubberized to provide maximum stability. No more dealing with risky sharpening stones! Our sharpener features the following stages: Stage 1: Vertical put the Blades at \"CORAMIC\" place(near the handle),Pull the Blades Back for about 5 times, With a little force.Stage 2: Vertical put the Blades at \"COARSL\" place(in the middle),Pull the Blades Back for about 3 times Slightly.Stage 3: Vertical put the Blades at \"FINE\" place(farthest from the handle),Pull the Blades Back for about 3 times Slightly Complete Control: The 3 Stage knife sharpener is one of the easiest to use. The process is very simple, but it will still require two hands. Grab the sharpener’s handle and hold it tightly to the table. While holding it securely, you will want to grab the handle of the knife and pull it through the sharpener. This process can be repeated, until the edge matches your requirements. Overall, the process is simple and can be completed within a matter of seconds. --You never have to worry about getting the right angle.--Accommodates knives of most types and sizes.--Carefully designed to prevent accidental cuts.--Made using durable and high-grade sharpening rods.You could simply sharpen your knife and get them back to the high standard they were when you first purchased them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xgVMEYswL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beatou","source_asin":"B0759QBZ93","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0759QBZ93","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0759QBZ93","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869214,"name":"Niels Bohr Atom Model Hanging Mobile - 9 Inches - Steel - Handmade in Denmark by Flensted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712PS4fLlLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How can I clean my mobile? Mobiles made of cardboard should only be dusted with a soft brush. Mobiles made of wood, aluminium or plastic can be wiped with a moist cloth with a few drops of mild dishwashing detergent. How long can my Mobile last? One person called us and said that they had inherited a Science Fiction Mobile from her grandmother who had had it for 30 years! In our home we have had the same mobile hanging for more than 20 years. Can my mobile hang outdoors? No. Since they are very sensitive to the simplest whiff of air hanging them outside is not recommendable. Will my mobile fade? In many of our mobiles we use plastic foil. This material is lightproof and easy to clean. Some other mobiles are made of cardboard. Even though we use the highest quality cardboard it will fade over the years. Red colors fade more than blue. You can delay fading by hanging the mobile out of direct sunlight. When hanging your mobile, try it in different places and bear in mind the following suggestions: 1. The mobile is designed to be a pleasure to the eye and a stimulus to the imagination. Hang out of reach of children. It is not a toy.2. Hang it away from direct sunlight to avoid the colors fading and the shapes distorting.3. Hang it where there is some movement of air but no strong draft. A slow, quiet movement is the essence of the mobile. Do not hang it outdoors.4. Where practical, hang the mobile where it has a subdued, uniform background. A corner position against light-colored walls is often the best location.5. If possible, hang it in the light from a lamp. The shadow that the mobile casts onto a wall or ceiling will give the mobile yet another dimension. A candle is a concentrated light source which will produce distinct, well-defined shadows.6. Hang the mobile where you can watch it while listening to music. You will see the mobile move to the rhythm of the music.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712PS4fLlLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flensted Mobiles","source_asin":"B00IKP4GFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IKP4GFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IKP4GFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
