window.products.push({"id":869419,"name":"Airdog V5 Car Air Purifier - Patented TPA Technology Quiet Portable Air Purifier for Car, Washable Filter, Remove 99.9% of Dust, Smoke, Odors, and Har","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Orph9XbTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Reusable Lifetime Filter] Unlike common HEPA car air purifiers, the Airdog air purifier for cars uses a washable non-consumable filter. If you are into saving money and the world at the same time, this is the best way to do it, this washable filter will save you 500$ per year and avoid polluting the environment. Airdog's car air purifier is what you were looking for, everyone wins the planet and yourself with the energy-efficient and waste-free design. [Patented TPA Technology: Active Filtration] Airborne contaminants are an issue you would like to get rid of? Say goodbye to allergies, congestion, and sneezing caused by contaminants with the Airdog portable air purifier for car, featuring TPA technology that captures 99.9% of particles as low as 0.0146 microns to PM 2.5 (VOCs, odors, exhaust) and large particles (smoke, pollen, dust, pet hair). TPA filters don't just collect but terminate harmful particles. [High Filtration Performance] Enjoy clean, fresh air in minutes with the car air purifier ionizer. In daily driving, there are many invisible health threats in the car, such as exhaust, odor, smoke, pet hair, etc. This car ionizer air purifier can completely purify a large SUV in 10 minutes, CADR: ≥ 8.7CFM. If you are a taxi driver, this is the best option since you can regulate the clean wind speed; if you are pregnant or with a baby, it aids to keep the air clean while keeping a low noise. [Wide Application] Thanks to the car air purifier's compact and portable design, you can take it to the car or hotel, office, bedroom, or even to the bathroom for fresh and clean air anytime and anywhere you need it. It comes with a strap so you can tie it to the back of the chair and easily install the electronic smoke eliminator anywhere inside your vehicle, such as the armrest, headrest, or under seats. This sleek and minimalist portable air purifier for car will be a great choice for you. [Work Automatically] To ensure that you focus on driving, the portable air purifier for car has an intelligent automatic system so it will turn on and off when you use or stop using your car. It also has a built-in sensor that shows notifications when the filter needs to be washed. This car air purifier for smokers is an ideal car essential gift for your parents, friends, and colleagues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Orph9XbTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airdog","source_asin":"B07ZFX8YKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZFX8YKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZFX8YKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869420,"name":"Bester heard Nonstick Skillet Frying Pan 11 inch Egg Pan Omelet Pan, Nonstick Cookware Granite Coating…","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713gV2-O-BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Notes for using: 1. Before the first use, tear off the label, rinse the pan with water and dry it up. Smear the pan with a thin layer of cooking oil (except butter and lard) as maintenance. After washing, it is ready for use. 2. Use heat-resistant nylon, plastic or wooden spatula while cooking. Avoid sharp spatulas or metal utensils to scratch the surface of the nonstick pan. 3. Nonstick cookware conducts heat evenly. You only need to cook over low to medium heat to produce delicious food. Please make sure there is food or water in the pan while cooking over high heat. 4. After use, make sure to wash the pan after it cools down. Please do not rinse it with cold water immediately after use. In case of resistant stains, you can clean it with a sponge soaked in hot water and detergent. Please do not scrub the pan with sand cloth or metal wool. 5. Please be noted that the cooking temperature has to be capped at 250 degrees Celsius. It is unsuitable for cooking acidic food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713gV2-O-BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bester heard","source_asin":"B0974DV5SG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0974DV5SG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0974DV5SG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
