window.products.push({"id":869463,"name":"Nurxiovo Commercial Orange Juicer Machine 110V/120V Automatic Citrus Juicer Electric Juice Squeezer Lemonade Making Machine Heavy Duty #304 Stainless ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fi8DC0oIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍊SUPER MOTER - This commercial orange juicer can quickly squeeze orange juice, pomegranate juice, lemon juice, up to 25-30 oranges per minute. Pure copper motors can extract up to 70 percent of the juice, which means a glass of orange juice can be squeezed out of 3-6 oranges. 🍓304# STAINLESS STEEL - The lemon squeezer machine is made of stainless steel, which makes it perfectly durable and sturdy. It can be used regularly for business purposes or at home. The powerful 120W motor is incredibly resistant, you won’t have to worry about overheating. 🍊EASY TO CLEAN - The commercial orange juice machine is easy to clean even after a long orange juice production process, you won’t be left with a machine full of hard-to-clean rests. Instead, You only have to wash it quickly, which will help you focus on much more interesting tasks. 🍓HIGH SAFETY FACTOR - The 110V/120V orange maker machine will not start working without the cover. So you won’t have to worry about incidents. And in case you would want to shut the machine down instantly, you only have to push the safety switch. 🍊MORE COMMERCIAL - This electric commercial orange squeezer can be used in groggery stores, restaurants, hotels, supermarkets, shopping malls, fruit shops, schools, canteens, gym clubs, drink shops, bars, offices ets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fi8DC0oIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nurxiovo","source_asin":"B07XMC5969","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XMC5969","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XMC5969","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869464,"name":"Art Wall Koi Fish and Water Lily Unwrapped Canvas Art by Michael Creese, 28 by 22-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.15,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jiJve4NqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Michael Creese 'Koi Fish and Water Lily' unwrapped canvas is a high-quality canvas print depicting a pair of koi fish swimming in a colorful pond with water lilies in the artist's signature vibrant, oil impasto style. A beautiful addition to your home or office. Michael Creese was born in Chicago, Illinois and studied art at Carnegie Mellon University, where he received a Bachelor of Fine Arts degree. He paints in the oil impasto style, a technique used in art where paint is laid thickly on canvas, leaving visible brush (or palette knife) strokes. When dry, impasto provides a great deal of texture to the finished painting. He also works with several other mediums in addition to oils. \"My particular style of painting is a culmination of my fine art training, my fondness for the Impressionist and Expressionist art movements and my personal artistic vision. Color and composition are two key elements to my creative process, but the application of paint is perhaps the single most important factor in defining my style, from loose brush strokes and rich texture to an almost frenzied use of palette knife marks. The colors that I use are frequently blended directly on the painting, adding liveliness through visibly distinct transitions in color and shade. I have been told that one of the nicest features of my style, even though it is representational, is its abstract quality. This is one aspect of painting that I truly enjoy and one that I have worked hard to preserve. But apart from all the explanations of technique or style, I think that you will find as I have that art is mostly a mystery so much more than the sum of its parts.\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jiJve4NqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtWall","source_asin":"B00HZJ450K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HZJ450K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HZJ450K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869465,"name":"Emile Henry Ceramic Bread/Potato Cooker | Burgundy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":140.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619Lp9ezpXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since 1850, Emile Henry has produced in France a large range of high quality ceramic cooking utensils. With a 10 year guarantee, our products are made from natural materials and have been designed and manufactured in France, in Southern Burgundy. Controlled production, without waste, is part of our daily commitment: the CO2 expelled from our workshops is particularly low thanks to our modern firing techniques that require less energy. The waste in general is recycled and the water used in production is filtered and used again in the production process.Our dishes have always been produced in France, in Marcigny in the south of Burgundy: it is a tradition and savoir-faire which has been handed down from generation to generation. Each worker prepares his moulds, produces his dishes and signs each one with his initials. We are proud of this responsibility entrusted to each of our workers, which is a pledge of quality for all our production.Our Potato Pot allows you to cook all kinds of vegetables at a low temperature (potatoes, chestnuts, etc.) bringing out their delicate flavours while keeping their natural characteristics. Made from Flame ceramic, it can be used on all types of hob: gas, electric and halogen (with an induction disk for induction hobs) and in the oven. Its spherical shape is designed to diffuse the heat gently and evenly. When used on the hob, turn it over every 15 minutes: your vegetables will be tasty, and potatoes will be soft with a crispy skin. All Emile Henry products are made in France and offer a ten years guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619Lp9ezpXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B072QXSV6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072QXSV6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072QXSV6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
