window.products.push({"id":869564,"name":"DHP Convertible Sofa Bed and Couch Futon, Width: 69\",Depth: 34\",Height: 31\", Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":262.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oKuem-SuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simple yet unique, the DHP Mara Futon did not hold back with its design and versatile construction. The Mara has modern style that features a rich velvet upholstery with intricate tufting on the backrest to bring a chic element to the futon’s simple design. Perfect to add to your living room, den, family room, home office or guest bedroom, the DHP Mara Futon is built with a versatile construction. The multi-functional split-back design easily converts between three positions – sitting, lounging and sleeping – to provide extra space to accommodate overnight guests. With a simple push or pull, you can make the Mara the perfect spot for any occasion. Want to read a book on a Saturday morning? Leave it in a sitting position. Want to lay back and watch a television series? Adjust it into a lounging position. Want to take a much-needed afternoon nap? Convert it all the way down to a sleeping position. With the DHP Mara Futon, it’s that simple. Available in multiple colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oKuem-SuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DHP","source_asin":"B08S8CZ71P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S8CZ71P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S8CZ71P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869565,"name":"Baby Shower Decorations Kit For Boys","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Mpb8PQbxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Baby showers are one our favorite activities here at Party Pax! The only issue is all the time and money it takes to put together decorations and accessories for a fun one. The \"It's A Boy\" Baby Shower Kit, has everything you need to give the parents-to-be a special shower without breaking the bank. The kit includes one \"Mommy-To-Be\" sash, one \"Dad-To-Be\" button, one \"It's a Boy\" banner, 6 Photo Booth Props, 20 Blue Polka-Dot Balloons, and 6 Blue Pom Poms. This kit has it all covered and is sure to deliver a memorable time for the expecting parents and others celebrating this big moment!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Mpb8PQbxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Party Pax","source_asin":"B01FEU9NB2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FEU9NB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FEU9NB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869566,"name":"Zulay (5 inch) Stainless Steel Kitchen Funnel - Food Grade Metal Funnel With Removable Filter - Rustproof Stainless Steel Funnel For Filtering or Tran","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MgdqmgRIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classic Sleek Funnel: Separate liquids and larger solids in significant volumes conveniently with the Zulay Kitchen Funnel. Made from top-grade stainless steel with a mirror-polished surface. It is sturdy, durable, and thick enough to handle dry ingredients, powdered mixtures, cold, and even hot fluids when you need to transfer them into a container. Dimensions: 2 inches strainer length, 4.5 inches mouth diameter Smooth Filling System: Constructed with a 4.5 inches mouth with an integrated trickle groove thoughtfully designed to allow air to pass through the neck of the container without any burping or backsplash. Perfect for transporting hot, cold or thick liquids, oil, spices and dry powdered ingredients. Versatile & Functional: Our one-piece stainless steel funnel is equipped with a detachable strainer for filtering liquids or dry ingredients. You'll be surprised by how many uses this funnel will have in your kitchen compared to the traditional plastic funnels. This is more on the stable and heavier side, which is perfect if you want stability; it steadily fits into your container’s mouth, preventing accidental spillage. Easy To Use & Maintain: Ergonomically designed with a ring located at the side which is useful for protecting your hands when transferring or filtering hot substances while using the funnel. Can also be used for storing, unlike other regular funnels that can be stored normally by moving into another container. Stainless steel is naturally resistant to corrosion therefore cleaning this tool is super easy whether by hand wash or in your dishwasher. No Hassle, Zulay Guarantee: We love and take pride in our Stainless Steel Funnel and we back this up with a lifetime guarantee. If there are ever any issues, just contact us and we will make it right. Order now and be assured that this product will live up to your expectations, guaranteed. If it does not, we got you covered (even after the Amazon return window). Chances are, you will never need to reach out!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MgdqmgRIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B089PTFFW1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089PTFFW1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089PTFFW1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
