window.products.push({"id":869690,"name":"Elements Metal Leaf Pillar Sconces (Set of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81papePXxnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Elements Metal Leaf Pillar Sconces will add a warm glow to any room in your home. These sconces feature hand-painted metal twigs and leaves. Hang on the wall to bring warm, ambient light to any room in your home. This set includes two (2) metal leaf pillar sconces. These sconces are intended for use with pillar candles only. Candles are not included; sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81papePXxnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elements","source_asin":"B00825MEWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00825MEWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00825MEWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869691,"name":"Digital Meat Thermometer, Umedo 2 in 1 Waterproof Instant Read Food Thermometer with Alarm Set, LCD Backlight & Calibration, Dual Probe Magnet Cooking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XWhJND1oL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥩 2-IN-1 FOOD GRADE PROBE MEAT THERMOMETER - The Umedo food thermometer comes with dual stainless steel probes, one built-in and one external extension of 40'' wire. The external probe allows you to keep the oven door closed while grilling. It has an 10-minute auto-shutdown function, LCD backlight, HOLD, CAL, temp chart and alarm button. With its multiple functions, the Umedo Kitchen Thermometer is an ideal all-purpose kitchen assistant. 🚀 CLEAR & PRECISE DIGITAL DISPLAY - The instant read meat thermometer provides you with a prompt result in just 2-3 seconds. The food thermometer has a wide temperature range of -58℉-572℉ (-50°C~300°C) with high accuracy up to +/- 2°F, perfect for all your daily cooking needs. The large backlit display makes it easy to read even in dimly lit kitchens or bright outdoor environments. ⏰ TEMPERATURE ALARM SETTING FOR PERFECT COOKING - Umedo food thermometer features a count-up and countdown setting that is perfect for long-time cooking. The receiver will sound an alarm once it reaches the pre-set temperature, ensuring no more cooking failures.【Note】All Umedo grill thermometers are pre-calibrated and ready to use. If the accuracy exceeds ±3 °C, you can easily re-calibrate it by following the steps on the manual or detail page, or contact us at any time! 💦 IP65 WATERPROOF AND DURABLE - This digital cooking thermometer can be rinsed directly without worrying about water getting inside (NOTE: Be sure to close the jack hole and avoid submerging the food thermometer in water.). Please be careful when washing the extra probe and keep the plug joint area dry. The built-in 4.53\" probe is long enough to keep you from burning your hands while measuring. It's perfect for liquids, food, meat, candy, milk, and even bathwater. 🧲 EASY TO USE AND CONVENIENTLY STORE - You just need to open it to turn on the food thermometer and fold the probe back to turn it off. The HOLD button enables you to freeze the temperature reading on the display so that you can read it after removing the food thermometer from the cooking area. Umedo meat thermometer for Cooking has a hanging hole and strong built-in magnet, making it easy to hang in the kitchen hooks or stick to the fridge, dishwasher, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XWhJND1oL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umedo","source_asin":"B0C2Q4J2GH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2Q4J2GH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2Q4J2GH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869692,"name":"Maleficent Poster - Watercolor Inspired Bedroom Print - Nursery Wall Art Decor - Birthday Gift for Boys Girls (8x10)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xTRsaZnKL._AC_SL1140_.jpg","description":"This poster looks mysterious, and there are two reasons for that. First, of course, because it features Maleficent, and you never know what’s on her mind. Second, the watercolor stylization helps a lot. It makes sure that the poster is free from unnecessary details, but also adds beautiful color gradients and watercolor smudges that can’t but attract attention. This creative modern artwork will blend perfectly into a bedroom or baby nursery interior. It’ll also help you get ready for a theme party or prepare a birthday gift for a boy or girl. Kids who like Maleficent are going to love this poster too. This Maleficent wall poster comes in one size – 8 x 10 inches. Please note that we sell it unframed, but it’s up to you to choose a frame for it if you like. It might make your brand-new Maleficent decoration even more exquisite.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xTRsaZnKL._AC_SL1140_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PGbureau","source_asin":"B085F2BTV3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085F2BTV3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085F2BTV3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
