window.products.push({"id":869811,"name":"FantasyDay 5-piece Stainless Steel Piping Tips Piping Nozzles Cake Decorating Supplies Cookies Cupcake Icing Decorating Supplies Decorating Kits Frost","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yWGRL+XIL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Ideal Biscuits Stainless Steel Icing Nozzle DIY Tools for Cookie, Cupcake and Cake Decorating. The piping nozzles are Made of stainless steel. You can use it to create your own beautiful cakes and cookies. It contains swirls, rosettes, flowers, roping, stars, leaves and other designs. This set of piping nozzles includes 5 stainless steel icing nozzles tips. Feature Material: 304 Stainless Steel Color: Silver Package Weight: 50g Usage Instructions 1. Clean your nozzle, wash in hot soapy water and dry. Prepare the piping bag, cut to allow the nozzle to pop out 1-2mm, then insert the nozzle into the bag. 2. Put the buttercream in a bag. Buttercream must be firm,room temperature, not too soft. 3. Place the nozzle to the cupcake/cake base,while squeezing gently,life nozzle. 4. Clean the end of the nozzle. 5. Use a leaf nozzle to fill in gaps--this will complement the overall effect. 6. If the buttercream is too soft the buds will be closed.Pop in the fridge,if necessary. 7. After use,wash in hot soap water and dry. Durable and unique nozzle tips create variety of styles cakes, Appling a little pressure to get stunning designs in your cakes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yWGRL+XIL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FantasyDay","source_asin":"B075L2KZ18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075L2KZ18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075L2KZ18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869812,"name":"Gold-Rimmed Charger Plates - Set of 6 - 13-Inch Elegant & Food-Safe Plastic Chargers with Electroplated Rim - for Small to Regular-Sized Dinnerware & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91A7TE7CZOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a way to add some flair to your table presentation? Gone were the days when the elaborately designed charger plate was reserved for white-table events and fine dining restaurants. Now, you can own and use these right at home, and you don't need to have an occasion to bring them out. But with all the many designs out there, how do you know which one to choose? If you're looking for something simple yet sophisticated with a hint of subtle luxury, then have we got just the thing for you! Level up your table presentation with our Gold-Rimmed Charger Plates! The subtle yet stunning white and gold combination of our charger plate won't take attention away from your dishes. Rather, it complements them and enhances their appeal and presentation. Using our charger plate is an excellent way of protecting your table cloth from food stains. The wide rim can catch most crumbs and morsels, and provide a barrier for your linen against soups and stews. Considering their intended purpose, it's normal for charger plates to get dirty. But don't worry, our charger plate doesn't require much effort to clean. In most cases, you simply need to rinse it with clean water and dry it with cloth before storage. For grease and oils, you'll need to use some liquid detergent. In any case, remember to never place the charger plate in the dishwasher as this may damage it. Still not convinced? Here are more features of our charger plates to help you decide: Non-microwavable Lightweight & sturdy Perfect present for weddings and housewarming parties Handwash only not dishwasher safe Add a little more flair to your meals at home. Add the Gold-Rimmed Charger Plate to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91A7TE7CZOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHATEAU FINE TABLEWARE","source_asin":"B08D9W1W7P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D9W1W7P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D9W1W7P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869813,"name":"Large Nuummite Palm Stone Very Thick 400+ carats and 2 3/8\" Long Smooth, Luminescent Oval Shaped Hand Stone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+370+N9eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nuummite (Nuumite/Nummit) is a very unusual stone. Some people call it a Metaphysical Talisman and some call it The Sorcerer’s Stone. Anthophyllite and Gedrite have crystallized with laminates of an iridescent spectral of colors. These colors range from gold, copper, yellow, purples, silver, green, and blue both separately or in combination of colors. The more specks or threads of color, the more unusual and valuable the stone becomes. The stones are mostly black and are magical. The stone provides for a circular energy connecting the base to the crown spiraling energy through all the chakras hopefully leading to the ethereal purity of the body. Thus, with each stone, one can journey deep into the core of oneself. It assists one in seeing your mystical revelation but also the facades that others may emit. Its preventative and protecting shield is very strong, allowing one to ward away all types of negative energy. It works on the bodily, spiritual and emotional levels. It is a powerful meditation stone, opening doors for oneself, one’s self-mastery and goals manifested for one’s life. It is a very powerful good luck stone, increasing frequencies of synchronicity that even Jung would have enjoyed. It is also said to help one find Love in ones heart. With its spiraling effect, it is said to help the intellect, memory and practicality needed to not only act but to verbalize ones thoughts. It is said to help assist other healing stones to add to their power. For some, it is said to help heal tissue regeneration, headache pain, and degenerative nerve diseases. In addition, it disperses infections, as well as purifying and stimulating the blood and kidneys. This is a very powerful mystical stone. So if you are feeling stressed or anxious, Nuummite will help support and power provided to you. Please feel free to try this beautiful black stone with its different colored luminescent threads or specks. These stones mostly black and feel smooth and good.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+370+N9eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Peony Silk Road","source_asin":"B00GG3TY84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GG3TY84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GG3TY84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
