window.products.push({"id":869870,"name":"Digital Kitchen Food Scale 3000g/0.1g Multifunction Weight Scale Gram Ounces, Electronic Jewelry Scale High Precision LCD Display/Stainless Steel/Tare","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eejtVkfxL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"FENG@YE Digital Kitchen Food Scale is easy to measure ingredients without having to do any math, save your time. A healthy diet starts now!!! Specifications ●Maximum Capacity: 3000g/6.6lb/3000ml ●9 Measurement Unit: g/oz/ml/ct/kg/tl/fl:oz/lb:oz/lb ●Batteries Require: 2 x AAA (included) ●Material: ABS+ Stainless Steel Plate ●Work temperature: 0 ~ 40℃ ●Storage temperature: -20 ~ 60℃ ●LCD size: 2x0.9in ●LCD display: White font ●Scale size: 8.3x6.1x1.18 in ●Net weight: 12.52oz Why choose \"FENG@YE\" electronic scale? ♦Food-Grade Safe Weigh Scale ---Made with Stainless Steel and ABS material that can put food on it directly. ♦Multiple Units ---Effectively measure in g, oz, ml, ct, kg, tl, lb, fl:oz, lb:oz. You can switch units to measure flour, vegetable, water, fruit, coffee, etc. ♦High Precision ---Built with the latest sensor technology to provide the highest precision in the industry. Weighs from 0.5g up to 3000g in precise graduations of 0.1g. ♦Tare Function ---Weigh smaller ingredients and liquids inside the included bowl without weighing the bowl itself. ♦Low Battery Indicator ---It will remind you to change battery to keep your measurements accurate. ♦Auto Off Function ---After 2minutes of Non-Use to preserves battery life while giving you time to confirm each measurement. ♦Overload Indicator --When items exceed the maximum load-bearing range. Please remove item quickly to protect the scale. ♦Lightweight & Portable ---This size of scale can meet your daily needs without taking up too much space, easy store. ♦Stainless Steel Finish ---This scale is crafted with a durable, easy to clean surface and adds an elegant touch to your kitchen. Package 1 x Digital Kitchen Scale2 x AAA Carbon Zinc Batteries1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eejtVkfxL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FENG@YE","source_asin":"B08P368XP9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P368XP9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P368XP9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
