window.products.push({"id":869933,"name":"Hand Mixer Electric, Cusinaid 5-Speed Hand Mixer with Turbo Handheld Kitchen Mixer Includes Beaters, Dough Hooks and Storage Case (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JcfASUhwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Compact Powerful and Durable Electric Hand Mixer You Deserve It! Premium electric hand mixer with beaters, dough hooks and storage container helps you effortlessly whisk, mix and knead for baking and cooking. Operating Hints: Most recipes provide the required time and speed needed.  SPEED 1-2: For mixing dry ingredients with liquids, folding whipped egg whites and cream into mixtures, stirring gravies and sauces and mashing vegetables. SPEED 3-4: For mixing cake mixes, pudding or batters. Using the dough hooks when mixing dough or heavier cake mixes. Using for creaming together shortening and sugar. SPEED 5: For whipping cream, evaporated or powdered milk, egg whites or whole egg. Using for mixing minced meat or kneading heavy dough. TURBO: Faster than speed “5” HOW TO CLEAN 1, Unplug the application. 2, Clean the body of the application using only a dump cloth. 3, Clean the beaters or dough hooks under running water or in the dishwasher. Rinse and dry. 4, On completion of using your application it is strongly recommended that you clean the accessories immediately.  This will remove any bath drying out of the residue food. Making cleaning easier and reducing the possibility bacterial growth. Warm Tip: 1,Turn the control knob to the right in position\"0\" when you eject the beaters, dough hooks or balloon whisk. 2,In the case of the beaters, dough and whisk of hand mixer can not fall out easily, we improved the ejection and pulling force, so maybe you should need two fingers to push the eject button for the first few uses. 3,Do not operate more than 5 minutes at one time. After 5 minutes continuous use, allow a few minutes rest before next use. Specification Power: 250 wattsVoltage: 120 V Package Include 1 x Electric Hand Mixer2 x Beaters2 x Dough Hooks1 x Balloon Whisk1 x Storage Case1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JcfASUhwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUSINAID","source_asin":"B07RKRYZTX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869933","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RKRYZTX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RKRYZTX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869934,"name":"SPLASH Home PEVA 5 Gauge Light Flight Curtain Design, for Bathroom Shower and Bathtubs, Free of PVC, Chlorine and Chemical Smell, 100% Waterproof 70 x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kYJOimWeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your family safe and healthy with non-toxic PEVA/EVA shower liners. The greatest danger in your bathroom could be your new vinyl shower curtain. The polyvinyl chloride (PVC) products are laden with 108 volatile organic compounds and poisonous chemicals that emit toxic gas into the air which can persist for the first 28 days. PVC plastic is softened with hormone-disrupting phthalates and includes chlorine which creates Dioxin, a carcinogenic chemical formed during its creation and destruction. Dioxin is dangerous since it easily penetrates the food chain of the planet as it can travel widely without breaking down. A recent study found that in just six hours after opening a PVC shower curtain, your bathroom would be exposed to volatile organic compounds over 16 times the allowable levels for indoor air quality established by the US Green Building Council and the Washington State Indoor Air Quality Program. Bottom Line: Be wise and don't put your family at risk with polyvinyl chloride (PVC) shower curtains. Guarantee To Keep You Safe with the PVC Free Shower Curtain Liner. Keep your bathroom clean and dry with the 5 Gauge EVA Shower Curtain liner from Splash Home. The Shower Curtain Liner is 100% waterproof and does not need a liner to be functional. The length of this curtain makes it perfect for standard ceilings and keeps water in the shower or tub and not on your floor!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kYJOimWeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPLASH","source_asin":"B003LHVFA8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869934","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003LHVFA8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003LHVFA8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
