window.products.push({"id":869993,"name":"Granny Bee Bourbon Cask Scented Candle - Masculine Candle with Cognac and Rosewood - Luxury Candle for Men - 11 Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-6PXs+mPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BOURBON CASK - Complex and subtle, this fragrance is for people who want to accentuate an experience. Bourbon is an acquired taste. This candle provides all the sophistication of cask-aged bourbon in an elegant glass you can burn for weeks. We take fragrance seriously. As with all Granny Bee's products, if you are not 100% satisfied, we will provide a full refund or replacement. Granny Bee's classic scented candles are always hand-poured and come gift-ready in a beautiful glossy box. Housed in smooth, sleek glass that accents every decorative fashion, these candles demand compliments for looks as well as fragrance. Made with a premium soy wax that holds an abundance of aromatic oil, Granny Bee's Candles are one of the most highly-scented container candles on the market. Since they are dye free ,the mellow creamy color will match any décor. All Granny Bee Candles contain 100% Lead-free wicks , so you can enjoy the 60-hour burn time worry free. This candle is a great gift for the men in your life, or as a thoughtful way to accent any occasion. Share the experience for Christmas, Easter, Mother’s Day, as a Wedding Gift, Birthday, Housewarming, or thank you gift.*Don’t miss out on any of our other delicious fragrances: Cashmere, Bourbon Cask, Crème Brulee, French Vanilla, Fresh Cut Flowers and Hot Apple Pie.** About Granny Bees CandlesIn 1999, a mother and daughter-in-law wanted to make a jar candle better than what they could buy. They wanted a highly-scented, long-lasting, container candle that would not only add fragrance to a room but could permeate the entire home. After coming up with this fabulous candle, they did what most folks would have done. They bragged about them and began sharing them with friends and family. That’s all it took! Granny Bee’s Candles was born.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-6PXs+mPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Granny Bee's Candles","source_asin":"B07GQCMYG3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GQCMYG3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GQCMYG3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":869994,"name":"California Design Den Hotel Paisley Luxe Duvet Cover Set, King, Royal Taupe, 3-Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RbCLkT8qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"King – 3 Pc Set What's included in this set? 1 King Duvet Cover 102 in. x 90 in. 2 King Pillow Shams 20 in. x 36 in. Features: Made from Microfiber with Jacquard Print Each Duvet Cover features 4 Internal Corner Ties to Avoid Slippage Convenient Zipper Closure for keeping your Comforter intact Hotel Paisley Luxe Duvet Cover Set includes 1 Duvet Cover and 2 Pillow Shams Our Products are Manufactured in a Certified Socially Compliant Factory Packed in a Reusable Canvas Fabric Bag Product Description Add a brilliant main attraction to your bedroom with the luxury Hotel Paisley Luxe taupe king size duvet cover set by California Design Den. With a sleek, polished sheen and intricate woven paisley design, this king size duvet cover set is custom-made to give you a penthouse suite experience. The silky material is as durable as it is effortless to maintain. Refresh your bedding, revamp your space. These microfiber duvet covers are a dreamy addition for any room's bold, soft, luxurious, and effortless to clean. Complement your down duvet or down alternative duvet with the duvet set of your dreams. Our king duvet cover set comes complete with 1 ultra-soft, all-season duvet, and 2 king size shams. Enjoy a crisp, classic refresh with a white duvet, or turn up a neutral with a brighter color. No matter what color you choose, you'll enjoy supreme quality. Our solid duvet set is hand stitched by a skilled artisan, then inspected to ensure perfection. Every design is brilliantly colored with premium dyes, so they retain their vibrancy over time. If you're in the market for a full/queen duvet or king duvet look no further. There's no better time to upgrade your room to master suite status. Please Note: Comforter or Duvet insert is not included in this Set. * Photos Disclaimer: Although we try our best to reflect true shade on every photo, different mobile phones or computers show them differently. So actual color/shade may vary. **","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RbCLkT8qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"California Design Den","source_asin":"B07C42CKBH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-869994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C42CKBH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C42CKBH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
